    <obo:IAO_0000115>An occurrence of trypsinization, i.e., proteolysis using trypsin, often used to dissociate cells adhering to a vessel in which they have been cultured; or, an attribute of such an occurrence, e.g., of being, becoming, or having been broken apart or dissociated through such an occurrence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
