    <rdfs:label>ERK</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>Any extracellular-signal-regulated kinase (ERK), also known as a classical MAP kinase, in either gene or gene product form.  These are widely expressed protein kinase intracellular signaling molecules that are involved in functions including the regulation of meiosis, mitosis, and postmitotic functions in differentiated cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
