    <rdfs:label>growth hormone receptor</rdfs:label>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>A gene or gene product that bears the functionality of combining with a growth hormone and transmitting the signal from one side of the membrane to the other to initiate a change in cell activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
